## PROJECT STRUCTURE (Strictly Enforced)
Organize code exactly like this:

Sources/
├── App/                  # @main App, Scene, environment setup
├── Features/             # One folder per feature
│   └── {FeatureName}/
│       ├── Views/
│       ├── ViewModels/
│       └── Models/
├── Shared/
│   ├── Components/
│   ├── Modifiers/
│   └── Styles/
├── Models/               # Domain models
├── Services/             # Network/, Persistence/, etc.
└── Core/
    ├── Extensions/
    ├── Utilities/
    └── Constants/

Use feature-first modular design. Keep files focused and small.